      "instance_name": "recycling_bag",
      "label": "brown paper bag with recycling symbol",
      "description": "A brown paper bag with a printed recycling symbol (three arrows forming a triangle) is filled with crumpled paper and cardboard, indicating it is being used for recycling. The bag is visibly full and slightly torn at the top, suggesting active use. It is attached to the front of a bicycle.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
