      "instance_name": "recycling_bike_scene",
      "label": "recycling_bag_attached_to_bicycle",
      "description": "A brown paper recycling bag filled with paper waste is attached to the front of a light blue bicycle. The bag is positioned in a white wooden crate mounted on the bike's front rack, with the bicycle's handlebars and front wheel visible. The background consists of green foliage, suggesting an outdoor setting. The scene is framed to emphasize the recycling bag as the central subject, with the bicycle serving as its support structure.",
