      "description": "The meme uses the derogatory racial slur 'white trash' to demean individuals from lower socioeconomic backgrounds, sarcastically praising their recycling behavior. This reinforces negative stereotypes and can cause emotional harm or reinforce prejudice against them.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
