      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "white_trash_stereotype",
      "label": "Target Community",
      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience familiar with and likely to understand the derogatory racialized and class-based slur 'white trash,' which targets white people from lower socioeconomic backgrounds, particularly those perceived as poor or lacking in social status. The intended audience is likely to recognize the stereotype and the sarcastic mockery embedded in the meme, deriving humor or satisfaction from the reinforcement of negative stereotypes about this group.",
